    title: "US ambassador to Israel undercuts Trump's announcement that aid to Israel will end this year",
    summary: "US ambassador to Israel undercuts Trump's announcement that aid to Israel will end this year US Ambassador to Israel Mike Huckabee has undercut US President Donald Trump's assertion earlier this month that he \"won't be paying Israel\" by the end of this year. Huckabee, the former governor of Arkansas who is an evangelical pastor and a staunch Zionist - by his own description - said on Tuesday at a conference in Tel Aviv that he's \" not certain that there will be a cessation on an abrupt basis by the end of this year\". That's because Washington currently gives Israel $3.8bn a year, in a 10-year memorandum of understanding that runs from 2019 to 2028. The package also includes $3.3bn in foreign military financing and $500m in cooperative missile defence programmes. t aid to Israel will end this year Students carry placards depicting US President Donald Trump and Israel's caretaker Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu carrying guns, as they march during a general strike over rising living costs and military spending called by the CGIL trade union, in Milan, Italy, on 20 November 2026 (Claudia Greco/Reuters)",
